# Pairs with EveryCommitAudited. WriteFinalAsync writes the final record
# without the create-only check (or under a key that differs per writer), so
# a caller finalizing after the reconciler already resolved its intent adds a
# second record for the same call.
MODULE: AuditFinalKeyPerWriter
TARGET: EveryCommitAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the final record is written blindly rather than create-only
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
finals' = IF HasFinal(o) THEN finals ELSE finals \cup {Row(o, outcome, op[o].actor, "caller", op[o].secret, op[o].long)}
--- REPLACE
finals' = finals \cup {Row(o, outcome, op[o].actor, "caller", op[o].secret, op[o].long)}
--- END
